XIX. ⚓ QUAY

The Quay stores:

CLAIM
ATTESTATION
EVIDENCE
WITNESS
CHALLENGE
VERIFICATION

as separate append-only objects.

Historical structure:

W100
 │
 └── IdentityClaim IC1
        │
