XXII. 💀 SELF-SIGNED ≠ SELF-PROVEN

PALACO now formalizes:

SIGNATURE

as proof of:

> authorship / possession of signing authority



not automatically:

> truth of the signed statement.



Therefore:

SelfSignature ✓

does not imply:

IdentityProof ✓

This distinction should propagate throughout the entire Proof Machine.


