A proof becomes SURVIVABLE only when:

Original Evidence          PASS
Original Provenance        PASS
Witness Identity           PASS
Historical Authority       PASS
Temporal Anchor            PASS
Archive Preservation       PASS
Independent Reconstruction PASS
Replay                     PASS
Cryptographic Integrity    PASS
Succession Records         PASS

Then:

EPISTEMIC_SURVIVAL = PROVEN

Otherwise:

EPISTEMIC_SURVIVAL = UNPROVEN


