XXXVI. 🌌 THE FOUR GREAT BOUNDARIES

R6.19–R6.44 now establish four distinct anti-fiction barriers:

💧 WATERMARK

> No fabricated continuity.



👁️ WITNESS

> No fabricated independence.



🧬 MIGRATION

> No fabricated equivalence.



📜 INTERPRETATION

> No fabricated historical meaning.



Together:

NO FABRICATED HISTORY.

NO FABRICATED WITNESS.

