XI. 🧠 BRAINPOWER

BRAINPOWER can construct the comparison graph:

A-W20 ─────┐
           ├── event E17
B-W20 ─────┤
           └── event E19

It can identify:

possible contradiction
possible fork
possible missing evidence
possible causal dependency

But:

BRAINPOWER MAY DISCOVER THE QUESTION. IT MAY NOT INVENT THE ANSWER.


