XIII. 🔬 TRIAS

TRIAS verifies the reconciliation procedure.

It asks:

Was every archive correctly identified?

Were scopes preserved?

Were witness claims valid?

Were watermarks independently verified?

Was replay performed?

Were conflicts explicitly registered?

Was uncertainty preserved?

Was authority applied according to constitutional rules?

TRIAS does not simply ask:

> Which archive has more votes?




