XXI. 🔥 REPLAY AS ARBITER

Replay becomes one of the strongest reconciliation mechanisms:

History A
   ↓
Replay
   ↓
A-W'

History B
   ↓
Replay
   ↓
B-W'

Compare:

A-W' == A-W ?
B-W' == B-W ?

If both succeed but differ:

FORK

If one fails:

REPLAY_DIVERGENCE

If both converge:

CONSISTENCY_CONFIRMED


