    Superseded,
}

The transition:

CLOSED → REOPENED

must itself be proven.


---

XI. 🚨 REOPENING REQUEST

A reopening request becomes:

REOPENING_REQUEST

containing:

question_id
new_evidence
evidence_root
provenance
materiality_claim
requested_scope
requester

It does not immediately alter the original finding.


---

XII. 🦆 FOOL

FOOL becomes a constitutional guardian against premature closure.

FOOL may issue:

CLOSURE_CHALLENGE

with:

INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE
UNDECLARED_UNCERTAINTY
THRESHOLD_ERROR
SCOPE_ERROR
WITNESS_CONFLICT
PROVENANCE_DEFECT
MATERIAL_EVIDENCE_IGNORED
PROCEDURAL_FAILURE

But FOOL does not automatically reopen the case.

It initiates constitutional review.


---

XIII. 🧠 BRAINPOWER

BRAINPOWER can continuously search for:

new evidence
contradictory evidence
historical anomalies
cross-archive inconsistencies
previously unlinked provenance
new replay paths

But its role remains:

DISCOVERY

not:

AUTHORIZATION

Therefore:

DISCOVERY MAY TRIGGER REVIEW; IT MAY NOT BYPASS CLOSURE.


---

