CLOSURE IS A GOVERNANCE ACT, NOT A CLAIM OF OMNISCIENCE.

The system may say:

> We have sufficient verified evidence to act on this conclusion.



without claiming:

> No future evidence could ever change our understanding.



That is the correct epistemic posture for an evolving autonomous civilization.


