│
├── W1
├── W2
├── W3
└── FINAL-WA
        │
        ▼
   SUCCESSION
        │
        ▼
GENERATION B
│
├── W-B1
├── W-B2
└── W-B3

The tree remains branched across generations.

It is not flattened.


