The Quay must preserve:

generation identity
constitutional identity
historical watermarks
succession events
succession proofs
inherited authorities
expired authorities

Therefore archival retirement of Constitution A does not mean:

DELETE A

It means:

A = HISTORICAL GENERATION

with its own constitutional memory.


