That is the next frontier.

☄️🌱 R6.51 — CONSTITUTIONAL GENESIS & FIRST-PRINCIPLE ANCHOR PROTOCOL

THE BEGINNING MAY HAVE NO ANCESTOR — BUT IT MAY NEVER HAVE NO PROOF

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.50 — Constitutional Succession, Ancestral Inheritance & Cross-Generation Authority Transfer
Core primitive: GENESIS_ANCHOR
Secondary primitives: GENESIS_PROOF, FIRST_PRINCIPLE, FOUNDATION_WITNESS, GENESIS_WATERMARK

Primary invariant

> A constitutional genesis state MAY have no predecessor, but SHALL possess an explicit genesis basis, first-principle commitments, independent evidence, and a verifiable genesis watermark.



R6.19 established:

> NO LINK → NO CLAIM OF CONTINUITY.



R6.50 established:

> A CONSTITUTION MAY INHERIT HISTORY; IT SHALL NOT MANUFACTURE HISTORY.



R6.51 now establishes:

🌱 NO ANCESTOR ≠ NO PROOF.


