II. 🔱 GENESIS IS A SPECIAL STATE

A genesis state is not merely:

predecessor = None

That would be dangerously insufficient.

A malicious system could simply omit its predecessor.

Therefore:

pub struct GenesisAnchor {
    pub genesis_id: GenesisId,
    pub constitution_id: ConstitutionId,
    pub first_principles_root: FirstPrinciplesRoot,
    pub foundation_evidence_root: EvidenceRoot,
    pub witness_root: WitnessRoot,
    pub provenance_root: ProvenanceRoot,
    pub ruleset_hash: RuleSetHash,
    pub created_at: Timestamp,
    pub genesis_watermark: WatermarkId,
    pub signature: Signature,
}

The absence of a predecessor must itself be explained and proven.


