   ↓
INITIAL RULESET
   ↓
GENESIS WATERMARK

Conceptually:

W₀ =
H(
    ConstitutionHash
  + FirstPrinciplesRoot
  + FoundationEvidenceRoot
  + WitnessRoot
  + RuleSetHash
  + GenesisTime
)

The genesis watermark therefore anchors not a predecessor, but the first constitutionally verifiable state.


