XXXII. ☄️ THE GREAT DISTINCTION

R6.51 gives PALACO three fundamentally different origin conditions:

1. GENESIS_PROVEN

No predecessor established.
Foundation proven.

2. GENESIS_UNPROVEN

No predecessor currently known,
but foundation insufficiently established.

3. FABRICATED_GENESIS

A predecessor or prior dependency is proven,
but was concealed or falsely denied.

These states must never collapse into one another.


