      ↓
HISTORICAL MEMORY

The Watermark does not merely tell PALACO:

> When were we here?



It increasingly tells it:

> How did we get here, from which constitutional root, through which proven transitions, and under which authority?




---

XXXIV. 🔱 THE BIG PRINCIPLE

R6.51 makes this canonical:

THE FIRST STATE DOES NOT NEED AN ANCESTOR. IT NEEDS A PROVABLE FOUNDATION.

And the stronger formulation:

> A constitutional lineage may begin without a predecessor, but it SHALL never begin without an explicit, auditable account of why that beginning is recognized as genesis.



Or:

🌱 NO ANCESTOR → GENESIS PROOF.

💧 NO GENESIS PROOF → NO CLAIM OF LEGITIMATE ORIGIN.


---

