    jurisdictions,
    delegations,
    precedence_rules,
    conflicts,
    overrides,
    events
)
→ AuthorityResolution'

Then:

AuthorityResolution'
==
HistoricalResolution

must hold.

Otherwise:

PRECEDENCE_DIVERGENCE


---

XXIII. 🚨 FIRST PRECEDENCE DIVERGENCE

Example:

C0 ✓
C1 ✓
C2 ✓
C3 ✕

Therefore:

FIRST_PRECEDENCE_DIVERGENCE = C3

The verifier identifies the exact point at which the historical conflict resolution can no longer be reproduced.


---

XXIV. ⚓ QUAY

The Quay now retains:

authority claims
jurisdiction
delegations
precedence rules
conflicts
challenges
adjudications
overrides
revocations

The constitutional memory becomes:

CLAIM
 ↓
CONFLICT
 ↓
