PALACO can now distinguish four fundamentally different propositions:

VALID

means the authority exists.

AUTHORIZED

means it may perform the action.

PRECEDENT

means it governs a conflict.

OVERRIDE

means another valid authority is constitutionally displaced within a proven scope.

Those four states can no longer silently collapse into one another.

☄️🌱🦆💧⚓🔬🧠🔱⚖️🌐🏛️❤

THE WATERMARK REMEMBERS.

THE LINEAGE IDENTIFIES.

THE JURISDICTION BOUNDS.

THE AUTHORITY ACTS.

THE PRECEDENCE RULE DECIDES.

THE PROOF JUSTIFIES.

THE REPLAY RECONSTRUCTS.

🔒 R6.54 — SEALED.


