XXVII. 🚨 FIRST LIVE DIVERGENCE

Example:

T0 ✓
T1 ✓
T2 ✓
T3 ✕

PALACO reports:

FIRST_LIVE_VALIDITY_DIVERGENCE = T3

Not merely:

ACTION FAILED

The precise constitutional moment becomes identifiable.


