A long-running operation may produce:

W10
 ↓
START
 ↓
W11
 ↓
REVALIDATE ✓
 ↓
W12
 ↓
REVALIDATE ✓
 ↓
W13
 ↓
REVOCATION
 ↓
W14
 ↓
