☄️ R6.59 — CONSTITUTIONAL BRANCHING, FORK IDENTITY & MULTI-LINEAGE RECONCILIATION PROTOCOL

A FORK MAY CREATE MULTIPLE FUTURES — BUT IT MAY NEVER CREATE MULTIPLE PASTS

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.58 — Constitutional Migration State Transfer & Cross-Lineage Reconciliation
Core primitive: LINEAGE_FORK
Secondary primitives: FORK_IDENTITY, BRANCH_WATERMARK, ANCESTRY_PROOF, MERGE_PROOF, RECONCILIATION_ANCHOR

Primary invariant

