A message from A to B must identify:

sender
sender lineage
sender watermark
sender authority scope
message
evidence
signature
recipient
recipient lineage

Thus B can determine:

> Who sent this?



> Under which constitutional state?



> With what authority?



> Can the sender prove its identity?




