B: permitted by policy
C: conditionally tolerated
D: emergency exception

Therefore:

IDENTICAL REPRESENTATION
        ≠
IDENTICAL MEANING

And:

TRANSLATION
        ≠
EQUIVALENCE

This becomes constitutional.


