That is a major forensic capability.


---

XXX. 🔬 SEMANTIC REPLAY

The Proof Machine now receives:

Replay(
    historical_watermark,
    historical_events,
    historical_ruleset,
    historical_semantics
)

and must reproduce:

historical_state
+
historical_interpretation
+
historical_authority_effect

If the result differs:

SEMANTIC_CONTINUITY_DIVERGENCE


