XXXII. 🛡️ MIGRATION GATE

A new semantic state may become active only if:

Predecessor                  PASS
Semantic Diff                PASS
Impact Analysis              PASS
Evidence                     PASS
Compatibility Proof         PASS
Authority Analysis           PASS
FOOL Challenge Window        PASS
TRIAS Verification           PASS
Migration Watermark          PASS
Replay                       PASS

Otherwise:

BLOCK


---

XXXIII. ⚠️ EMERGENCY SEMANTIC MIGRATION

An emergency change may be necessary.

