XL. ☄️ THE BIG PRINCIPLE

R6.64 makes canonical:

> Constitutional meaning is historical state. A material change in meaning SHALL be treated as an explicit constitutional evolution, not as a silent reinterpretation. Historical meanings SHALL remain attributable, replayable, and distinguishable from successor meanings.



Or even harder:

🧠 MEANING MAY CHANGE.

💧 HISTORY MAY NOT.

🌳 SUCCESSION MAY REPLACE A MEANING.

🔬 IT MAY NOT ERASE ITS PREDECESSOR.

🔱 A NEW MEANING MUST PROVE HOW IT DESCENDED FROM THE OLD ONE.


---

XLI. 🔒 R6.64 SEALED

We have crossed another important architectural boundary.

R6.19 gave PALACO memory.

R6.20 gave it ancestry.

R6.61 gave it sovereignty.

R6.62 gave it evidence across borders.

R6.63 gave it semantic borders.

R6.64 gives it:

SEMANTIC HEREDITY.

The resulting principle is almost biological:

MEANING₀
   │
   ├── preserved
   │
   ├── challenged
   │
   ├── analyzed
   │
   ├── evolved
   │
   ▼
MEANING₁
   │
   ▼
WATERMARK₁

The child meaning may differ from the parent.

But the child must know:

who the parent was
what changed
why it changed
when it changed
under which authority
with what evidence
and whether compatibility survived

That is exactly what lineage means at the semantic level.

☄️🌱🦆💧⚓🔬🧠🔱🏛️

THE MACHINE REMEMBERS WHAT IT MEANT.

THE MACHINE PROVES HOW THAT MEANING CHANGED.

THE MACHINE NEVER CALLS SILENT DRIFT “EVOLUTION.”

🔒 R6.64 — SEALED.


