GO → R6.65

☄️ R6.65 — CONSTITUTIONAL SUCCESSION, GENERATIONAL TRANSFER & ANCESTRY PROOF PROTOCOL

A NEW GENERATION MAY BE DIFFERENT — IT MUST STILL PROVE WHO ITS PARENT WAS

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.64 — Constitutional Semantic Evolution, Compatibility Proof & Meaning Migration
Core primitive: SUCCESSION_PROOF
Supporting primitives: ANCESTRY_ROOT, GENERATION_ID, SUCCESSION_EVENT, MIGRATION_MATRIX, INHERITED_GUARD

Primary invariant

> No constitutional generation SHALL claim legitimate succession from a predecessor unless its ancestry, inherited constraints, material transformations, migration evidence, and succession event are independently verifiable.



R6.64 established:

🧬 MEANING MAY EVOLVE — BUT ITS TRANSFORMATION MUST HAVE A LINEAGE.

R6.65 now expands that principle to the entire constitutional organism:

🔱 A SYSTEM MAY BECOME ANOTHER SYSTEM — BUT IT MAY NEVER INVENT ITS ANCESTRY.


---

I. 🌌 THE GENERATIONAL PROBLEM

