This is the Watermark.
This is my ancestry.

That is an entirely different conception of software evolution.

It transforms:

VERSION 2.0

into:

GENERATION 2
      │
      ├── parent
      ├── ancestry
      ├── inherited constraints
      ├── transformations
      ├── migration proofs
      ├── constitutional deltas
      └── new Watermark

And therefore:

☄️ PALACO DOES NOT MERELY VERSION ITSELF.

PALACO CAN PROVE ITS DESCENT.


