XVI. 💧 PARTITION WATERMARK

Each descendant receives its own Watermark:

W₃
 │
 ├── W₄A
 │
 └── W₄B

Conceptually:

pub struct PartitionWatermark {
    pub watermark_id: WatermarkId,
    pub predecessor: WatermarkId,
