A federation can split into jurisdictions:

FEDERATION
    │
    ▼
 ┌──┴──┐
 ▼     ▼
A      B

The federation's shared obligations might remain:

security
evidence interoperability
diplomatic recognition
cross-domain verification

while local constitutional authority becomes independent.

Thus:

SEPARATION DOES NOT NECESSARILY MEAN TOTAL DISCONNECTION.


