XXXVII. ☄️ THE BIG PRINCIPLE

R6.68 makes canonical:

> A constitutional synthesis MAY subsequently re-diverge into multiple descendants. Such re-divergence SHALL preserve the common predecessor, explicitly partition inherited guarantees, obligations, authorities, capabilities, and meanings, and independently prove the provenance and validity of every resulting descendant.



Or, compressed:

🌳 SHARED HISTORY DOES NOT REQUIRE SHARED DESTINY.

💧 A SPLIT MAY CHANGE THE FUTURE, NEVER THE PAST.

🔱 EVERY INHERITED GUARANTEE MUST HAVE A DESTINATION.

⚖️ EVERY AUTHORITY PARTITION MUST BE PROVEN.

🧠 BRAINPOWER MAY FIND THE SPLIT.

🦆 FOOL MAY CHALLENGE THE SPLIT.

🔬 TRIAS MUST PROVE THE SPLIT.

⚓ THE QUAY REMEMBERS THE PARENT AND ALL CHILDREN.


