ENTITY A
   │
   ├── Authority X
   ├── Authority Y
   └── Authority Z
          │
          ▼
      TRANSFORMATION
       /         \
      ▼           ▼
ENTITY B       ENTITY C
   │               │
   X?              Y?
   Z?              Z?

The next hard principle:

⚡ POWER HAS LINEAGE TOO.

🔐 NO CAPABILITY MAY CROSS A CONSTITUTIONAL BOUNDARY WITHOUT A PROVABLE AUTHORITY TRANSFER.

