☄️ R6.71 — CONSTITUTIONAL CAPABILITY LINEAGE, AUTHORITY PROVENANCE & POWER TRANSFER PROTOCOL

POWER MUST HAVE A PROVENANCE CHAIN

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.70 — Constitutional Identity, Entity Continuity & Subject Succession
