R6 progressively added:

UNDER WHICH RULE?
WHO VERIFIED IT?
WHERE DID IT COME FROM?
WHEN DID IT OCCUR?
WHO WAS THE SUBJECT?
WHO HAD THE POWER?
WHO WAS RESPONSIBLE?

R6.72 adds the final execution question:

WAS THE POWER ACTUALLY USED WITHIN THE AUTHORITY THAT GRANTED IT?

The complete chain is now:

