If PALACO discovers:

E₁ → E₂

was incorrectly attributed, it does not erase the historical record.

Instead:

CAUSAL CLAIM
 ↓
CHALLENGE
 ↓
REVIEW
 ↓
CORRECTION EVENT
 ↓
UPDATED CAUSAL STATUS
 ↓
NEW WATERMARK

The system preserves both:

WHAT WAS RECORDED

and:

WHAT IS NOW PROVEN


