BRAINPOWER may identify:

possible obligation
possible responsible subject
possible rule
possible remediation
possible deadline

But:

SUGGESTED DUTY ≠ DERIVED DUTY

BRAINPOWER cannot create constitutional obligations merely because an outcome appears undesirable.


