If:

Consequence ✓
Rule ✓
Subject ✕

then:

OBLIGATION_DERIVATION_FAILED

If:

Consequence ✕
Rule ✓
Subject ✓

then:

TRIGGER_UNPROVEN

If:

Consequence ✓
Rule ✕

then:

NO_CONSTITUTIONAL_BASIS

In all cases:

OBLIGATION = BLOCKED


