XIX. 💀 BREACH

If:

OBLIGATION = ACTIVE

and:

DUE_AT < NOW

without valid fulfillment:

BREACH

may be derived.

But again:

EXPIRATION OF TIME ≠ AUTOMATIC PROOF OF BREACH

The system must establish:

obligation was active
deadline was valid
deadline was reached
required fulfillment was not proven
no valid suspension/waiver existed

Then:

OBLIGATION_BREACH_PROVEN


