DOMAIN A CONSEQUENCE
       ↓
FEDERATED BASIS
       ↓
DOMAIN B OBLIGATION

The federation must prove why Domain B is bound.

FEDERATION MEMBERSHIP ALONE DOES NOT CREATE DUTY.

This extends the existing PALACO federation invariant:

> Federation membership SHALL NOT confer constitutional authority.



And now:

> Federation membership SHALL NOT by itself create constitutional obligation.




