R6.74-I35
Archived obligations SHALL remain independently verifiable.

R6.74-I36
Obligation status SHALL NOT be inferred from natural-language intent alone.

R6.74-I37
Normative reasoning SHALL remain distinct from constitutional authority.

R6.74-I38
No subject SHALL be assigned an obligation beyond the demonstrated constitutional basis.

R6.74-I39
