Preserve diplomatic confidentiality.

O₂:
Provide constitutionally required disclosure.

The system must not choose either based on preference.

It must inspect:

confidentiality rule
disclosure rule
jurisdiction
exception clauses
temporal validity
authorized reconciliation

Possible result:

preserve protected information
+
disclose required metadata

A third constitutional solution may satisfy both.


