XXVI. 🚨 FIRST CONFLICT DIVERGENCE

Example:

O₁ validity        ✓
O₂ validity        ✓
Conflict           ✓
Applicable rule    ✓
Priority basis     ✓
Resolution         ✕

Then:

FIRST_CONFLICT_DIVERGENCE = RESOLUTION

The Proof Machine identifies the precise failure.


---

XXVII. 🧠 AUTONOMOUS CONFLICT

For autonomous agents:

Agent detects:
O₁ ↔ O₂

The agent may:

detect
classify
simulate
propose

But may not silently:

override
suppress
reinterpret

without the applicable constitutional authority.

Therefore:

AUTONOMY DOES NOT INCLUDE CONSTITUTIONAL ARBITRATION BY DEFAULT.


