VIII. 🧭 ACCORD SCOPE

pub enum AccordScope {
    Recognition,
    EvidenceExchange,
    DiplomaticCommunication,
    Research,
    Federation,
    OperationalInteroperation,
    LimitedDelegation,
}

Scope is explicit.

Therefore:

RESEARCH

cannot silently become:

OPERATIONAL_INTEROPERATION

and:

OPERATIONAL_INTEROPERATION

cannot silently become:

SOVEREIGN_AUTHORITY


