XV. 🔥 BREACH

A breach is not merely:

> “Someone behaved badly.”



A breach is:

ACTIVE OBLIGATION
       ↓
REQUIRED CONDITION
       ↓
NON-SATISFACTION
       ↓
EVIDENCE
       ↓
VERIFICATION
       ↓
BREACH

This produces:

VERIFIED_BREACH

rather than an accusation.


---

XVI. 🚨 BREACH TYPES

pub enum BreachType {
    NonPerformance,
    LatePerformance,
    PartialPerformance,
    UnauthorizedAction,
    EvidenceFailure,
    ProvenanceFailure,
    ScopeViolation,
    AuthorityViolation,
    DisclosureViolation,
    GoodFaithViolation,
}

Each breach receives:

evidence
provenance
Watermark
principal
obligation
time
status


---

XVII. 🛠️ REMEDIATION

A breach does not necessarily terminate the Accord.

PALACO introduces:

BREACH
 ↓
NOTICE
 ↓
REVIEW
 ↓
REMEDIATION PROPOSAL
 ↓
NEGOTIATION
 ↓
ACCEPTANCE
 ↓
EXECUTION
 ↓
VERIFICATION

Thus:

ACCOUNTABILITY DOES NOT REQUIRE IMMEDIATE DESTRUCTION OF RELATIONSHIP.

The system can correct itself.


---

XVIII. 🧬 OBLIGATION AMENDMENT

An obligation may evolve:

O₁
 ↓
AMENDMENT
 ↓
O₁'

But:

O₁ ≠ O₁'

historically.

The system must preserve:

original obligation
amendment
reason
authority
evidence
effective Watermark

Therefore no retroactive rewriting.


---

XIX. 🕰️ DEADLINES

Deadlines become constitutional data.

OBLIGATION
   │
   ├── start
   ├── deadline
   ├── grace period
   └── terminal state

The system distinguishes:

ON_TIME
LATE
EXCUSED
WAIVED
BREACHED

A waiver itself becomes an evidence-bearing constitutional action.


---

XX. 🔐 WAIVER

A party cannot silently waive another party's obligation.

A valid waiver requires:

authority
scope
affected obligation
duration
reason
evidence
verification
Watermark

Thus:

WAIVER IS ITSELF A CONSTITUTIONAL ACT.


---

XXI. 🌳 OBLIGATION DEPENDENCY GRAPH

Some obligations depend upon others:

O₁
 ↓
O₂
 ↓
O₃

BRAINPOWER can model:

dependency graph

and detect:

O₁ incomplete
   ↓
O₂ cannot safely execute
   ↓
O₃ potentially blocked

The system must not falsely classify downstream obligations as breaches when their prerequisites were never fulfilled.

This introduces:

DEPENDENCY_BLOCKED

as distinct from:

BREACHED.


---

XXII. 🌐 MULTI-CITADEL OBLIGATIONS

The V.V.A. supports:

A → O₁
B → O₂
A+B → O₃
C → O₄

Shared obligations require explicit responsibility mapping.

For example:

O₃
 ├── A responsible for component A
 ├── B responsible for component B
 └── joint verification

No ambiguous:

> “The federation was responsible.”



The exact constitutional principals must be identifiable.


