We kunnen de hele laag samenvatten in één zin:

> A living constitutional world becomes governable when its distinctions are explicit, its determinations are provable, its specimens are identifiable, and its history remains preserved.



Of korter:

🌱 DISTINGUISH. DETERMINE. PRESERVE. TRACE.


