XXIV. 🔱 THE MASTER AXIOM

R6.104 kan daarom worden samengevat als:

> A NAME MAY DESCRIBE AN OBJECT.
A TAXON MAY CLASSIFY IT.
EVIDENCE MAY SUPPORT IT.
AUTHORITY MAY ACT UPON IT.
BUT ONLY PROVENANCE AND WATERMARK PRESERVE ITS HISTORY.



En:

NO NAME SHALL BECOME A MAGIC WORD.


