A
      ↙ ↓ ↘
     B  C  D
      ↘ ↓ ↙
        E

Niet iedere relatie is parent → child.

Er bestaan ook:

DEPENDENCY
COOPERATION
CONFLICT
INFLUENCE
RESOURCE SHARING
CONSTRAINT
FEEDBACK

Dus:

LINEAGE EXPLAINS ORIGIN.

ECOLOGY EXPLAINS RELATION.


