Taxonomy tells us how to classify.

Herbarium tells us what was classified, when, why and on what evidence.


---

XXI. 🧠 THE EPISTEMIC TRIANGLE

R6.117 creates a useful three-part distinction:

OBSERVATION
             /   \
            /     \
           /       \
      EVIDENCE ─ DETERMINATION

Observation

What was encountered.

Evidence

What supports the claim.

Determination

What the authorized system concludes.

No corner may silently substitute for another.


