WHAT CONDITIONS ARE REQUIRED?
WHAT RISKS EXIST?
WHAT DEPENDENCIES EXIST?
WHAT COMPATIBILITIES EXIST?

Maar:

BRAINPOWER MAY RECOMMEND CULTIVATION.

IT MAY NOT SECRETLY CULTIVATE IT.

Een recommendation is geen mutation.


---

IX. 🔬 TRIAS — CULTIVATION AUTHORITY

TRIAS controleert:

WHO CULTIVATES?
WHAT IS CULTIVATED?
WHY?
UNDER WHICH AUTHORITY?
IN WHICH HABITAT?
WITH WHICH CAPABILITIES?
FOR HOW LONG?
WITH WHICH SAFEGUARDS?

Daarmee wordt cultivation zelf een constitutional event.


---

X. 🦆 FOOL — THE GARDENER TEST

FOOL vraagt:

> “Who planted this?”



Daarna:

> “Who authorized planting it?”



Daarna:

> “What did it have permission to become?”



En:

> “What prevented it from becoming something else?”



De laatste vraag is cruciaal voor autonomous systems.


---

