R6.119 makes it explicit.

A valid transfer:

A
 │
 │ IDEA / KNOWLEDGE / PROPOSAL
 ↓
B

must retain:

SOURCE
TARGET
CONTENT
TIME
CONTEXT
AUTHORITY
EVIDENCE

Thus:

POLLINATION MUST BE TRACEABLE.


