The system must detect attempts such as:

A
 ↓
hidden capability
 ↓
B

where B suddenly possesses a capability without an attributable transition.

Possible state:

UNDECLARED_TRANSFER

or, where constitutional effect is implicated:

CONSTITUTIONAL_EFFECT = UNPROVEN

Z.A.N.D. prevents the system from inventing an explanation.


