but still asks:

WHO?
WHAT?
WHY?
UNDER WHICH AUTHORITY?
WITH WHICH SCOPE?
UNTIL WHEN?

A cooperative relationship therefore remains bounded.


---

IX. 🌱 DEPENDENCY

Dependency becomes explicit:

A
 ↓
DEPENDS_ON
 ↓
B

But:

> Dependency SHALL NOT silently become authority.



An application depending on a service does not thereby become subordinate to every decision made by that service.

Likewise:

B is essential to A

does not automatically mean:

B controls A


---

X. 🌿 COMPETITION

Competition can exist constitutionally:

A ↔ B

without becoming breach.

Competition becomes problematic only when a rule, obligation, boundary or authority is violated.

Therefore:

COMPETITION
≠
BREACH

and:

CONFLICT
≠
GUILT

Again:

determination follows evidence.


