Every habitat receives explicit boundaries:

BOUNDARY
├── MEMBERSHIP
├── COMMUNICATION
├── CAPABILITY
├── AUTHORITY
├── RESOURCE
├── TEMPORAL
└── TRUST

A boundary crossing becomes a material event where applicable.

A
 │
 │ CROSSING
 ↓
BOUNDARY
 ↓
B

must be attributable.


