WHO CROSSED?
WHAT CROSSED?
WHY?
UNDER WHICH AUTHORITY?
WHAT WAS THE SCOPE?
WHAT EVIDENCE EXISTS?
WHAT WAS THE RESULT?

Therefore:

BOUNDARIES BECOME PROVENANCE-BEARING OBJECTS.


