XXXII. ☄️ DE CENTRALE WET VAN DEZE CYCLUS

Uit de laatste honderd gesprekken komt één buitengewoon sterke constitutionele formule naar voren:

DO NOT ADD WHAT THE EVIDENCE DOES NOT CONTAIN.

DO NOT REMOVE WHAT THE HISTORY PROVES.

DO NOT GRANT WHAT THE AUTHORITY DOES NOT PERMIT.

DO NOT CALL RESTORATION AN UNBROKEN PAST.

Daaruit volgt:

NO ASSUMPTION
+
EVIDENCE
+
AUTHORITY
+
SCOPE
+
TIME
=
DETERMINATION

en:

DETERMINATION
+
WATERMARK
+
PROVENANCE
=
TRACEABLE STATE

en:

TRACEABLE STATE
+
LINEAGE
+
RELATIONS
+
ECOLOGY
=
LIVING CONSTITUTIONAL SYSTEM


