Constitutional relations SHALL possess authority provenance.

HGR-I05

Relations SHALL NOT inherit authority merely from proximity.

HGR-I06

Brainpower-generated relations SHALL remain candidates until determined.

HGR-I07

Material relation changes SHALL be watermarkable.

HGR-I08

Historical relations SHALL remain replayable.

HGR-I09

FOOL SHALL be able to challenge material graph edges.

HGR-I10

Lineage SHALL remain distinct from relation.

HGR-I11

Ecological prediction SHALL remain distinct from constitutional determination.

HGR-I12

No graph optimization SHALL silently rewrite historical provenance.


