ECO-B10

Expired consent SHALL NOT silently remain active.

ECO-B11

Historical consent SHALL remain replayable where constitutionally relevant.

ECO-B12

An ELIXER SHALL NOT inherit another ELIXER's authority merely through relationship.

ECO-B13

Citadel membership SHALL NOT create unrestricted internal authority.

ECO-B14

Cross-Citadel interaction SHALL require an explicit federation boundary.

ECO-B15

No ecological relationship SHALL silently override a constitutional boundary.


