EFFECTIVE AUTHORITY
=
ORIGIN AUTHORITY
∩
DELEGATION₁
∩
DELEGATION₂
∩
...
∩
DELEGATIONₙ

Never:

A + B + C

Authority is not additive.

It is bounded by intersection.

That is a very strong architectural principle.


