A security threat was detected.

PALACO temporarily restricted external actions under the Citadel's emergency protocol.

Scope: External transfers
Duration: Until threat resolution / constitutional review
Reason: [explanation]
History: Permanently recorded



The user sees:

WHAT
WHY
HOW LONG
WHO
WHAT HAPPENS NEXT

without receiving false impressions of unlimited authority.


